{"seq":2,"slug":"flow-logs-monitoring","title":"流日志与网络监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/security-operations/flow-logs-monitoring","wordCount":1378,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"流日志与网络监控\">流日志与网络监控</h1><p>网络可观测性是安全运营的基础——你无法保护看不见的流量。VPC 流日志（Flow Logs）记录了每一条网络连接的元数据，提供了审计、故障排查和异常检测的核心数据源。而网络监控则从性能和可用性角度持续追踪网络健康状态。两者结合构成了&quot;事前预警—事中可视—事后取证&quot;的完整观测能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>VPC Flow Logs</strong>：记录经过 ENI 的 IP 流量元数据（五元组、字节数、动作），是网络审计的基础数据源</li>\n<li><strong>流量路径（Traffic Path）</strong>：流日志中标识流量经过的网关类型（IGW / NAT GW / TGW / Peering）</li>\n<li><strong>Parquet 格式</strong>：列式存储格式，比文本格式节省 60-80% 存储成本且查询性能提升 10x</li>\n<li><strong>异常检测（Anomaly Detection）</strong>：基于历史基线自动识别偏离正常模式的流量行为</li>\n<li><strong>GuardDuty</strong>：AWS 的威胁检测服务，消费 Flow Logs 自动识别挖矿、数据外泄、端口扫描等威胁</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"vpc-流日志\">VPC 流日志</h2><p>VPC 流日志捕获经过弹性网络接口（ENI）的 IP 流量信息。每条记录包含五元组、字节数、包数、动作（ACCEPT/REJECT）和时间窗口。</p>\n<p>AWS VPC Flow Logs 的标准格式（v2）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>srcaddr</td>\n<td>源 IP</td>\n<td>10.0.1.50</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dstaddr</td>\n<td>目标 IP</td>\n<td>203.0.113.10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>srcport</td>\n<td>源端口</td>\n<td>49152</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dstport</td>\n<td>目标端口</td>\n<td>443</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>protocol</td>\n<td>协议号</td>\n<td>6 (TCP)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>packets</td>\n<td>包数</td>\n<td>42</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>bytes</td>\n<td>字节数</td>\n<td>8960</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>action</td>\n<td>动作</td>\n<td>ACCEPT / REJECT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>log-status</td>\n<td>日志状态</td>\n<td>OK / NODATA / SKIPDATA</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>自定义字段</strong>（v5 增强格式，截至 2026 年支持 40+ 字段）包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>flow-direction</code>：入站/出站</li>\n<li><code>traffic-path</code>：流量路径类型（通过 IGW / NAT GW / Transit GW / VPC Peering 等）</li>\n<li><code>tcp-flags</code>：TCP 标志位（SYN, ACK, FIN, RST）</li>\n<li><code>sublocation-type</code>：实例子位置（wavelength / outpost / localzone）</li>\n<li><code>pkt-src-aws-service</code> / <code>pkt-dst-aws-service</code>：标识 AWS 服务流量</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    ENI[弹性网络接口] --&gt;|流日志| Destination{投递目标}&#10;    Destination --&gt;|选项 1| CW[CloudWatch Logs]&#10;    Destination --&gt;|选项 2| S3[S3 Bucket]&#10;    Destination --&gt;|选项 3| KDF[Kinesis Data Firehose]&#10;    S3 --&gt; Athena[Athena 查询]&#10;    S3 --&gt; SIEM[第三方 SIEM]&#10;    KDF --&gt; OpenSearch[OpenSearch]&#10;    KDF --&gt; Splunk[Splunk]&#10;    CW --&gt; Insights[CloudWatch Insights]\">graph LR\n    ENI[弹性网络接口] --&gt;|流日志| Destination{投递目标}\n    Destination --&gt;|选项 1| CW[CloudWatch Logs]\n    Destination --&gt;|选项 2| S3[S3 Bucket]\n    Destination --&gt;|选项 3| KDF[Kinesis Data Firehose]\n    S3 --&gt; Athena[Athena 查询]\n    S3 --&gt; SIEM[第三方 SIEM]\n    KDF --&gt; OpenSearch[OpenSearch]\n    KDF --&gt; Splunk[Splunk]\n    CW --&gt; Insights[CloudWatch Insights]</pre><p><strong>作用域</strong>：流日志可以在三个级别启用——VPC（捕获所有 ENI）、子网（捕获该子网的 ENI）、ENI（单个接口）。生产环境推荐在 VPC 级别启用，投递到 S3（成本最低且支持 Parquet 格式压缩）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"流日志分析实战\">流日志分析实战</h2><p><strong>用 Athena 查询 S3 中的流日志</strong>：</p>\n<p>流日志投递到 S3 后可以使用 Apache Parquet 格式（按小时分区），结合 Athena 做即席查询。典型分析场景：</p>\n<p>查找被安全组拒绝的连接尝试：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT srcaddr, dstaddr, dstport, COUNT(*) as reject_count&#10;FROM vpc_flow_logs&#10;WHERE action = &#39;REJECT&#39; AND date = &#39;2026-07-18&#39;&#10;GROUP BY srcaddr, dstaddr, dstport&#10;ORDER BY reject_count DESC&#10;LIMIT 20\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> srcaddr, dstaddr, dstport, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reject_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vpc_flow_logs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'REJECT'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-07-18'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> srcaddr, dstaddr, dstport</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reject_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span></span></code></pre></div><p>识别异常出站流量（可能的数据外泄）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT srcaddr, dstaddr, SUM(bytes) as total_bytes&#10;FROM vpc_flow_logs&#10;WHERE flow_direction = &#39;egress&#39;&#10;  AND dstaddr NOT LIKE &#39;10.%&#39;&#10;  AND date BETWEEN &#39;2026-07-11&#39; AND &#39;2026-07-18&#39;&#10;GROUP BY srcaddr, dstaddr&#10;HAVING SUM(bytes) &gt; 1073741824  -- &gt; 1GB&#10;ORDER BY total_bytes DESC\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> srcaddr, dstaddr, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bytes) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_bytes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vpc_flow_logs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flow_direction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'egress'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dstaddr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '10.%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-07-11'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-07-18'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> srcaddr, dstaddr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bytes) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1073741824</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- > 1GB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_bytes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"跨平台流日志对比\">跨平台流日志对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>AWS VPC Flow Logs</th>\n<th>Azure NSG Flow Logs</th>\n<th>GCP VPC Flow Logs</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>粒度</td>\n<td>ENI 级别</td>\n<td>NSG 规则级别</td>\n<td>VPC 子网级别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采样</td>\n<td>全量（可选聚合窗口）</td>\n<td>全量</td>\n<td>可配置采样率（1/1 到 1/1000）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>1-5 分钟</td>\n<td>1-5 分钟</td>\n<td>实时（Pub/Sub）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>格式</td>\n<td>文本 / Parquet</td>\n<td>JSON</td>\n<td>JSON</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投递目标</td>\n<td>S3, CloudWatch, Firehose</td>\n<td>Log Analytics, Storage Account</td>\n<td>Cloud Logging, Pub/Sub, BigQuery</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本优化</td>\n<td>Parquet + Hive 分区</td>\n<td>Traffic Analytics（内建聚合）</td>\n<td>采样率控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>元数据丰富度</td>\n<td>40+ 字段</td>\n<td>NSG 规则名、流状态</td>\n<td>实例名、GKE 元数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>GCP 的独特优势是原生支持<strong>实时流日志</strong>——通过 Pub/Sub 投递可以实现秒级的异常检测响应。Azure 的 Traffic Analytics 提供了内建的流量可视化和异常检测，无需额外工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"网络性能监控\">网络性能监控</h2><p>除了安全审计，网络性能监控关注的是延迟、丢包和可用性：</p>\n<p><strong>AWS Network Monitor / Reachability Analyzer</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Network Monitor：持续测量到 AWS 端点和自定义目标的网络性能（延迟、丢包率、抖动）</li>\n<li>Reachability Analyzer：静态分析网络配置，判断两个端点之间是否存在可达路径——无需发送实际流量</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>VPC Lattice Access Logs</strong>：对于使用 VPC Lattice 的服务间通信，Access Log 提供 L7 级别的指标——请求延迟、响应码、目标组级别的健康状态。</p>\n<p><strong>Transit Gateway Flow Logs</strong>：2025 年起 TGW 支持独立的流日志，记录跨 VPC 的流量模式。这对于理解 hub-and-spoke 架构中的流量热点至关重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"告警与异常检测\">告警与异常检测</h2><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Detection Pipeline: Flow Logs</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>ETL</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>Metrics</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>Baseline</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>Anomaly Score</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>Threshold</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>Alert</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Detection Pipeline: Flow Logs} \\xrightarrow{\\text{ETL}} \\text{Metrics} \\xrightarrow{\\text{Baseline}} \\text{Anomaly Score} \\xrightarrow{\\text{Threshold}} \\text{Alert}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2948em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Detection Pipeline: Flow Logs</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ETL</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1191em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Metrics</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1081em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Baseline</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3025em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Anomaly Score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1081em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Threshold</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Alert</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>建立网络告警体系的关键指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>正常基线</th>\n<th>告警阈值</th>\n<th>可能原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>REJECT 包率</td>\n<td>&lt; 0.1%</td>\n<td>&gt; 5%</td>\n<td>安全组配置错误或扫描攻击</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨 AZ 流量比</td>\n<td>&lt; 20%</td>\n<td>&gt; 50%</td>\n<td>服务发现配置问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NAT GW 连接数</td>\n<td>&lt; 55000/min</td>\n<td>&gt; 50000/min</td>\n<td>连接泄漏或爬虫</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DNS 查询失败率</td>\n<td>&lt; 1%</td>\n<td>&gt; 10%</td>\n<td>DNS 配置错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单 IP 出站连接数</td>\n<td>&lt; 100/min</td>\n<td>&gt; 1000/min</td>\n<td>可能被入侵作为跳板</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>AWS CloudWatch Anomaly Detection 使用机器学习自动建立指标基线，检测偏离正常模式的流量。GuardDuty 则直接消费 VPC Flow Logs 进行威胁检测——识别加密货币挖矿、DNS 数据外泄、异常端口扫描等行为。</p>\n<p>关于如何基于这些监控数据自动化网络配置变更和响应，参见 <a href=\"network-automation-iac\">网络自动化与 IaC</a>。关于网络防火墙如何产生这些 ACCEPT/REJECT 决策，参见 <a href=\"network-firewall-waf\">网络防火墙与 WAF</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>VPC 流日志是网络可观测性的基石：在 VPC 级别启用、投递到 S3（Parquet + Hive 分区）实现低成本长期存储，结合 Athena 做即席分析、结合 GuardDuty 做自动威胁检测。关键告警指标包括 REJECT 包率、跨 AZ 流量比、NAT GW 连接数和单 IP 出站连接数。GCP 的实时流日志（Pub/Sub）和 Azure 的 Traffic Analytics 各有优势——前者支持秒级响应，后者提供开箱即用的可视化。网络监控的终极目标是将观测数据转化为自动化响应动作。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"流日志与网络监控","id":"流日志与网络监控"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"VPC 流日志","id":"vpc-流日志"},{"level":2,"text":"流日志分析实战","id":"流日志分析实战"},{"level":2,"text":"跨平台流日志对比","id":"跨平台流日志对比"},{"level":2,"text":"网络性能监控","id":"网络性能监控"},{"level":2,"text":"告警与异常检测","id":"告警与异常检测"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"网络防火墙与 WAF","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/security-operations/network-firewall-waf"},"next":{"title":"网络自动化与 IaC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/security-operations/network-automation-iac"}}